lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a cinema, friends are choosing movies, there are 40 screenings. Xiao Gang tells Xiao Mei: \"I think most of the screenings choose to watch comedy movies, some action movies, very few romance movies.\" Xiao Mei counts and finds that there are only 5 action movies.\n\n[Question]\nAfter Xiao Mei counts, how many comedy movies does she estimate?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After counting, Xiao Mei estimates 15 comedy movies.\nB. After counting, Xiao Mei estimates 5 comedy movies.\nC. After counting, Xiao Mei estimates 32 comedy movies.\nD. After counting, Xiao Mei estimates 35 comedy movies.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609364973041984,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5877a9aa9dc5a833d475c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475898423,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:31:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b244d7d55f2d4edeaf1bc2e0247ebb6b"}